Voluntarily Display Credits

    The last but not the least, I wish Tango Desktop Project not to be
    forgotten. Therefore, while GPLv2 and GPLv3 licenses do not permit
    adding extra obligations, we would greatly appreciate it if you
    choose to credit the original authors in your project:

    "Tango Desktop Project contributors from freedesktop.org"

    Either in About UI, documentation, or acknowledgements.

    This is a voluntary request and has **no** effect on your rights
    under the GPL.
